            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Ko",
            "review_text": "The-Mong-Melbourne-Australia\nMaroondah, Australia526 contributions\n0\nGone seriously downhill since pre pandemic\nMay 2022 • Family\nExtremely disappointing. Note my four out of 5 star review directly below from three years ago. When planning our trip back to Vietnam I ensured that we would make a visit to sushi co again based on how good it was last time. This time can be summarised as 2.5 stars at best, lazy service, reduced selection (for example no octopus no squid no scallops)… The cheese oysters were awful, the seared tuna was awful, the rest of the sushi was okay, the tempura prawns were good. Not worth the 20 minutes walk from our apartment. Would never go back here again.\nRead more\nWritten May 18, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
