            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Ko",
            "review_text": "The-Mong-Melbourne-Australia\nMaroondah, Australia526 contributions\n0\nGreat sushi, sake and beers\nSep 2019 • Family\nThis place cost about AUD$70 in total for three of us and we ate a truckload, had about six or seven beers some other drinks some saki. And probably ordered 10 different dishes. In Melbourne it would be like spending $250-300 at a suburban sushi place, in terms of comparing quantity versus cost. Everything was fresh, no sickness or anything so it will be the same quantity and hygiene as something in Australia. So all good, go and enjoy. The ice in drinks etc is all okay for Aussies to have. Cheers Mong\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2019",
