            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Ko",
            "review_text": "Zeroquai\nLondon, United Kingdom146 contributions\n0\nGreat Sushi in Dist 4\nNov 2017 • Couples\nWe came here for a drink and noticed the quality of the sushi going out to other tables - and decided we had to come back for dinner!\n\nGiven the setting, I had reservations about eating sushi (raw fish etc, how good a quality would the sashimi be?) - but we loved it here. \nThe quality was very good, and the prices extremely cheap considering the quality of food and size of a standard portion of any of the sushi/sashimi.\n\nWe loved it here and ate a couple of times over our stay in Vietnam. Plenty of other good options on Vinh Khanh street as well!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 15, 2017",
